; cobalt_screen is the Bonsai-free screen model: the cell mapping, layout geometry,
; scrolling, animation, the UI state and its transition, and the rendered frame as styled text
; spans. It must not depend on bonsai or bonsai_term, so headless tests can drive it.
; It uses notty only for [Notty.Tty_width_hint], the width table notty itself draws
; with, so that our cell counts agree with what reaches the terminal.
; It may use the pure VCS libraries (cobalt_vcs, cobalt_vcs_git: core only, no Async, no
; Unix) for the VCS view; never cobalt_vcs_host, which runs processes (cobalt_ui owns it).

(library
 (name cobalt_screen)
 (libraries cobalt_harness cobalt_config_runtime cobalt_completion cobalt_terminal cobalt_theme cobalt_error cobalt_app cobalt_core cobalt_input cobalt_highlight cobalt_palette cobalt_file_picker cobalt_file_preview_model cobalt_navigation_preview_model cobalt_line_picker cobalt_content_picker cobalt_tile cobalt_vcs cobalt_vcs_git core notty-community)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane)))
